# lib/Assembly-CSharp.dll is a PUBLICIZED stub (method signatures only, no IL) of the
# game's proprietary assembly. It is committed so CI can compile on a public runner
# (the real assembly takes over in-game via Mono late binding). Other lib binaries stay
# ignored — locally they may be symlinks created by `make link-asm`.
*/lib/*.dll
*/lib/*.pdb
